# ─── Design handoff source ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# The zip and its unpacked copy are reference material, not part of the site.
# `extracted/` is fully derivable from the zip, so it never needs tracking.
#
# WARNING: these two are currently the ONLY copies of the original JPEG
# masters and of Dave-Euson-Resume.docx (the editable source the PDF is
# exported from). Ignoring them keeps the repo lean but means a clone of this
# repo cannot rebuild those assets. Keep a copy somewhere off this machine.
#
# They also must not ship: GitHub Pages serves whatever is in the published
# branch, and the résumé inside the bundle carries a phone number that is
# deliberately kept off the site.
extracted/
*.zip

# ─── Local tooling state ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Live-mode session journals and resolved-root manifests are machine-local
# runtime state. `.impeccable/live/config.json` and `.impeccable/design.json`
# are project config and stay tracked.
.impeccable/live/sessions/
.impeccable/live/roots.json
.impeccable/live/inject-journal.json

# Personal Claude Code settings; .claude/launch.json is shared config and stays.
.claude/settings.local.json

# ─── Editor and OS noise ────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
